  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Scimitar\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1H_scimitar.png\" title=\"Scimitar\"><img alt=\"Scimitar\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/1H_scimitar.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Slashing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">One-Handed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">135\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">0.61\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Scimitar</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-fighter\">One-Handed-fighter</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from the old weapon lists.</p>\n<p>This weapon also exists in other materials (Cardboard Scimitar, Celestial Scimitar, Default Scimitar, Diamond Scimitar, Iron Scimitar, Obsidian Scimitar, Stone Scimitar, Tin Scimitar, …).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
